    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Exceptional 3-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home in a Peaceful Cul-de-Sac**\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached family home offers bright, spacious accommodation extending to approximately 90 sq m and is presented in exceptional condition throughout. Ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking a green, the property is just a short stroll from Portrane Beach and the popular Brook Pub.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled interior features an open-plan kitchen and dining area, a cosy lounge with a feature open fireplace, fitted wardrobes, a family bathroom and an oak-fitted kitchen complete with appliances. The home benefits from oil-fired central heating, newly installed double-glazed PVC windows and doors, a storm porch, alarm system and an insulated attic.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property boasts a freshly painted exterior, a cobble-lock driveway and a large landscaped rear garden with a patio area—perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining. There is also excellent potential to extend to the side and rear, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nWith the 33B bus stop conveniently located on the doorstep, providing transport to Donabate and onward to Swords, this superb home combines comfort, convenience and future potential in an enviable coastal setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Storm porch: \r\nTiled floor, \r\n\r\nEntrance hall: 11' 2\" * 5' 5\" \r\nLaminated floor, alarm panel, understairs storage. \r\n\r\nLounge: 12' 2\" * 11' 7\"\r\nLaminated floor, feature open fireplace, TV point, built in shelving units, views of the green. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room: 16' 5\" * 8' 7\" \r\nWall and floor mounted kitchen units, fridge/freezer, hob, oven, extractor fan, washing machine, tiled floor, tiled backsplash, door leading to the back garden. \r\n\r\nLanding: carpet, window, door to the attic, hot press. \r\n\r\nBedroom one: 12' 2\" * 10' 1\" \r\nLaminated floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom two: 9' 6\" * 8' 7\"\r\nLaminated floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom three: 9' 1\" * 7' 3\" \r\nLaminated floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBathroom: 6' 2\" * 5' 2\" \r\nWC, WHB, corner shower unit, electric shower, tiled floor, tiled walls, wood paneled ceiling, window. \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nRear: \r\nLandscaped lawned garden with a patio area, storage shed, side entrance, tap\r\n\r\nFront: Large Cobble lock driveway, steal gates,"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating\r\nNewly installed D/G PVC windows and doors\r\nAlarmed\r\nLandscaped gardens\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nFreshly painted exterior\r\nPotential to extend\r\nShort walk from Portrane beach\r\n33B Bus stop on your door step."
      },
